{"title":"gitlab_sec","url":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/categories/security/","favicon":"https://about.gitlab.com/images/ico/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"Securing the software factory at machine speed","contents":"<div class=\"image\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><img data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" fetch-priority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"></div><h2 class=\"sr-only\" data-v-329ca616=\"\">Featured post</h2><div class=\"text\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading4-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><!--[-->Securing the software factory at machine speed<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-heading5\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><!--[-->The foundation for agentic software development must evolve with AI models, continuously shortening the path from detection to verified remediation.<!--]--><!----></p><span class=\"slp-text-body3-bold author\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><!--[-->Author: Chaim Mazal<!--]--><!----></span><a class=\"cta slp-mt-16 slp-btn slp-btn-primary cta slp-mt-16\" data-ga-name=\"securing the software factory at machine speed\" data-ga-location=\"body\" href=\"/blog/securing-the-software-factory-at-machine-speed/\" data-v-c6fd7cb9=\"\" data-v-329ca616=\"\"><!--[-->Read Post<!--]--></a></div>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/securing-the-software-factory-at-machine-speed/","retrieved":1789771483130},{"title":"When to use SAST versus an LLM security scanner","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/sast-vs-llm-security-scanner/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"when to use sast versus an llm security scanner\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756989645/fojzxakmfdea6jfqjkrl.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1756989645/fojzxakmfdea6jfqjkrl.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756989645/fojzxakmfdea6jfqjkrl.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->When to use SAST versus an LLM security scanner<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->AI-based review and SAST catch different classes of bugs and both have benefits. Here's how to decide which one runs where, and when your team needs both. <!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/sast-vs-llm-security-scanner/","retrieved":1789578768328},{"title":"GitLab Dedicated: Compliance for a new regulatory era","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/gitlab-dedicated-compliance/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"gitlab dedicated: compliance for a new regulatory era\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab Dedicated: Compliance for a new regulatory era<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Streamline compliance with GitLab Dedicated. Gain isolation, control, and audit readiness for DORA, NIS2, and GDPR in a single-tenant SaaS environment.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/gitlab-dedicated-compliance/","retrieved":1789414390481},{"title":"Prepare for the Cyber Resilience Act's 24-hour reporting deadline","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/cyber-resilience-act-reporting-deadline/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"prepare for the cyber resilience act's 24-hour reporting deadline\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Prepare for the Cyber Resilience Act's 24-hour reporting deadline<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Under the Cyber Resilience Act, manufacturers have 24 hours to report an actively exploited vulnerability in their product. See how GitLab helps you answer fast.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/cyber-resilience-act-reporting-deadline/","retrieved":1789070238839},{"title":"GitLab compliance frameworks: Adhere to SOC 2 in minutes","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/quick-compliance-with-compliance-framework-templates/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"gitlab compliance frameworks: adhere to soc 2 in minutes\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1773866173/vte9qh8rriznvyclhkes.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1773866173/vte9qh8rriznvyclhkes.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1773866173/vte9qh8rriznvyclhkes.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab compliance frameworks: Adhere to SOC 2 in minutes<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Use GitLab custom compliance framework templates to enforce SOC 2 and more, monitor adherence continuously, and cut audit prep from weeks to clicks.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/quick-compliance-with-compliance-framework-templates/","retrieved":1787863291295},{"title":"When your backlog outgrows your team, GitLab scales remediation","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/gitlab-scales-remediation/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"when your backlog outgrows your team, gitlab scales remediation \" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1787143586/nrl2nvddlghnnjtmuxoa.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1787143586/nrl2nvddlghnnjtmuxoa.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1787143586/nrl2nvddlghnnjtmuxoa.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->When your backlog outgrows your team, GitLab scales remediation <!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Clear your existing backlog and drive down risk with bulk false positive detection and vulnerability resolution.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/gitlab-scales-remediation/","retrieved":1787475456449},{"title":"How GitLab tracks vulnerabilities through refactors and reformatting","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/improved-scope-offset-fingerprinting/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"how gitlab tracks vulnerabilities through refactors and reformatting\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->How GitLab tracks vulnerabilities through refactors and reformatting<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Learn how GitLab's improved Scope+Offset fingerprinting keeps vulnerability tracking stable across comments, blank lines, and reformatting.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/improved-scope-offset-fingerprinting/","retrieved":1787475456451},{"title":"GitLab Secrets Manager adds ESO, Terraform, API support","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/gitlab-secrets-manager-add-eso-terraform-api-support/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"gitlab secrets manager adds eso, terraform, api support\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab Secrets Manager adds ESO, Terraform, API support<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Simplify credential management across your stack. GitLab Secrets Manager provides secure retrieval in Kubernetes, Terraform, and external workflows.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/gitlab-secrets-manager-add-eso-terraform-api-support/","retrieved":1787475456453},{"title":"Secure every commit to production with Claude and GitLab","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/claude-security-and-gitlab/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"secure every commit to production with claude and gitlab\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Secure every commit to production with Claude and GitLab<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Claude Security catches vulnerabilities inside a coding session. GitLab picks up from there, scanning, enforcing policy, and producing audit evidence for the software lifecycle. <!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/claude-security-and-gitlab/","retrieved":1787475456454},{"title":"GitLab Duo Security Review spots logic flaws scanners miss","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/gitlab-duo-security-review-flow/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"gitlab duo security review spots logic flaws scanners miss\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1783980535/t3gez0gpayfndrhncunf.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1783980535/t3gez0gpayfndrhncunf.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1783980535/t3gez0gpayfndrhncunf.png\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab Duo Security Review spots logic flaws scanners miss<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-6e0d4060=\"\"><!--[-->Use AI-driven security reasoning to detect authorization gaps, business-logic errors, and race conditions while code is still under review.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/gitlab-duo-security-review-flow/","retrieved":1787475456455}]}